      "status": "preserved"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0010:0001",
      "source": "The property only applies to a video connection.",
      "ko": "이 속성은 비디오 연결에만 적용됩니다.",
      "sourceHash": "26a167ca5d23560a93f0268170a3dfc1a63c8f7a2d1f3c5201b4b28d57fca0af",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0011:0001",
      "source": "If the value of [`isVideoOrientationSupported`](avcaptureconnection/isvideoorientationsupported.md) is [`true`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/true), you can set `videoOrientation` to rotate the video buffers consumed by the connection’s output.",
      "ko": "[`isVideoOrientationSupported`](avcaptureconnection/isvideoorientationsupported.md) 값이 [`true`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/true)인 경우 `videoOrientation`을 설정하여 연결 출력에서 사용되는 비디오 버퍼를 회전시킬 수 있습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "758eb112cf9a5d7980e6ca04a2bcc377dfab70d1feb6caad6cdf72adb9c187a9",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0011:0002",
      "source": "Setting `videoOrientation` doesn’t necessarily result in a physical rotation of video buffers.",
      "ko": "`videoOrientation`을 설정해도 비디오 버퍼가 실제로 회전한다는 보장은 없습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "ca98447116d7d288521d316a29c029a6a7d836fb8a817e94618c5511d0109e0d",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0011:0003",
      "source": "For example, a video connection to an [`AVCaptureMovieFileOutput`](avcapturemoviefileoutput.md) object handles orientation using a QuickTime track matrix.",
      "ko": "예를 들어, [`AVCaptureMovieFileOutput`](avcapturemoviefileoutput.md) 개체에 대한 비디오 연결은 QuickTime 트랙 매트릭스를 사용해 방향을 처리합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "04fdde0bba342125ff8d6403ad77fe081a61a7db9cb9864e0eb6d6b26c0617fa",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0011:0004",
      "source": "A video connection to an [`AVCaptureStillImageOutput`](avcapturestillimageoutput.md) object handles orientation using EXIF tags.",
      "ko": "[`AVCaptureStillImageOutput`](avcapturestillimageoutput.md) 개체의 비디오 연결은 EXIF 태그를 사용해 방향을 처리합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "4bd9d856ecd719a139e758854ef8a1ceea93e59d347ca70fc32a74c3cdcdf307",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0012:0001",
      "source": "[`AVCaptureVideoDataOutput`](avcapturevideodataoutput.md) clients may receive physically rotated pixel buffers in their [`captureOutput(_:didOutput:from:)`](avcapturevideodataoutputsamplebufferdelegate/captureoutput(_:didoutput:from:).md) delegate callback.",
      "ko": "[`AVCaptureVideoDataOutput`](avcapturevideodataoutput.md) 클라이언트는 [`captureOutput(_:didOutput:from:)`](avcapturevideodataoutputsamplebufferdelegate/captureoutput(_:didoutput:from:).md) 델리게이트 콜백에서 실제로 회전된 픽셀 버퍼를 받을 수 있습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "724448e5e95b35414151050d6e40c1016dbf079435a42e75eff3757ead0ab4f5",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0012:0002",
      "source": "The `AVCaptureVideoDataOutput` hardware accelerates the rotation operation and supports all four [`AVCaptureVideoOrientation`](avcapturevideoorientation.md) modes.",
      "ko": "`AVCaptureVideoDataOutput`는 하드웨어 가속으로 회전 작업을 수행하며 모든 네 가지 [`AVCaptureVideoOrientation`](avcapturevideoorientation.md) 모드를 지원합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "54b61263811fcc676eefaf8e85f844ebf9f66bf643029314e1b528367efd1636",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0012:0003",
      "source": "A client sets `videoOrientation` or [`isVideoMirrored`](avcaptureconnection/isvideomirrored.md) on the video data output’s video [`AVCaptureConnection`](avcaptureconnection.md) to request physical buffer rotation.",
      "ko": "클라이언트는 비디오 데이터 출력의 비디오 [`AVCaptureConnection`](avcaptureconnection.md)에서 `videoOrientation` 또는 [`isVideoMirrored`](avcaptureconnection/isvideomirrored.md)를 설정하여 실제 버퍼 회전을 요청할 수 있습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "6d995dba5365db3555c2fc75ff72bf9c51f9f6e1a36dfbd30772ae7a4c8360bd",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:blockquote:discussion:0013:0001",
      "source": "❗ **Important**: Physically rotating buffers comes with a performance cost, so only request rotation when necessary.",
      "ko": "❗ **중요**: 버퍼를 실제로 회전하면 성능 비용이 발생하므로 필요한 경우에만 회전을 요청합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "ca7e7696d5c94a6dcf17f2625de1b6e31ad12a2ae78acd76afe278997b7537db",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:blockquote:discussion:0013:0002",
      "source": "If you want to write rotated video to a movie file using [`AVAssetWriter`](avassetwriter.md), set the [`transform`](avassetwriterinput/transform.md) property on the [`AVAssetWriterInput`](avassetwriterinput.md) instead.",
      "ko": "[`AVAssetWriter`](avassetwriter.md)를 사용해 회전된 비디오를 영화 파일로 쓰려면 대신 [`AVAssetWriterInput`](avassetwriterinput.md)의 [`transform`](avassetwriterinput/transform.md) 속성을 설정합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "d87a17f011be9c63b62b673c380cb29e9ec4bc4ee3cc5b985b77b76a65dbffe2",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
